4","title":"How do reheating and a post-inflationary epoch dominated by cold volume-modulus particles change the inferred horizon-exit e-fold count and spectral tilt of Kähler moduli inflation, and its compatibility with the Planck datasets available to the authors?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0026"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:acbcbb2a06ddda0a17aae4781b7ce43da9115305484a8da92c95f65d8698352d","title":"How do the QCD axion and more general axion-like particles arise, acquire masses and Standard Model couplings, populate the Universe, and produce observable particle or gravitational signatures? This is a short pedagogical review.","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0027"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:accfe2a19c4fb08ce0eb7fdd83f5012cde08774653f070f81705669e75537fb6","title":"What effective theory captures the leading higher-derivative deformations of four-dimensional vacuum GR black holes, including scalar-controlled couplings, and how do its rotating solutions modify Kerr horizon geometry, thermodynamic quantities, photon rings and scalar profiles?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0038"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:ac37a74b422c65cc41e8ddd0032c4ad51eb638d6dec3095110d7c615268fa418","title":"Can the axion endpoint prescription be derived beyond specific string constructions, and does it survive explicit nonperturbative shift breaking? Can running theta be constrained in QCD-like theories or supply useful vacuum branches in self-tuning models?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0041"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:ac3a3a17bc71b5f9af496d419306c8deb25ced2e9298b16c92be97d2230562bc","title":"How can matter be coupled to homogeneous string backgrounds while retaining manifest O(d,d) covariance to all orders in α', and what condi